## 🖥️ Basic Navigation

### Using File Explorer:
- Navigate folders visually
- Search files using the search bar
- Manage files via GUI

### Using Command Line (CMD):

cd          # Change directory
dir         # List files
cls         # Clear screen

Example:

cd C:\Users\Public
dir
